        "notes": "MiniCPM-V 4.7 35B-A3B on OmniCompass-VL. Overall Cross-Specification Consistency Score on a 0-100 scale, higher is better. Local inference uses the official openbmb/MiniCPM-V-4.7-35B-A3B BF16 weights through Transformers, with greedy decoding, temperature 0, one beam, and an 8192-token output budget. Each request uses 32 uniformly sampled video frames with visible original per-frame timestamps; the image reference, when present, follows the video frames. Both Text and Text+Image target specifications cover temporal grounding, spatial grounding, and question answering across 820 videos and 4920 successful requests. Six successful unparseable responses score zero. No truncations or policy exclusions. CS: TG 17.1, SG 9.1, QA 52.8, Avg 26.3. Completed on November 6, 2026. This is sparse-frame evaluation, distinct from native-video input. Model documentation: https://openbmb.cn/model/minicpm-v-4-7 Imported from the benchmark authors' published results and rounded to one decimal. This submission does not claim HF verified status."
